  "lineage": "Dance music of the Beni Snassen and neighbouring communities of north-eastern Morocco around Berkane, Oujda and Nador, historically a warriors' dance in which lines of men holding rifles move their shoulders and stamp to the gasba cane flute and bendir frame drums. It remains a staple of weddings and regional festivals and circulates on cassettes and wedding videos.",
